<title>AUSTRIA: SOCCER-RAPID 0 JUVENTUS 1 LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RAPID 0 JUVENTUS 1 LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
